      "body": "Add the Telemetry Collection use case, which is a generalization of SandboxAQ's sensors use case.\r\n\r\nThe main requirements it relates to is the asynchronicity of key udpates and key updates providing PCS.",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-03T12:25:08Z",
